  "known_hardware_constraints": [
    "D4 and D5 are confirmed reversed on assembled revision 0.1 hardware; configuration v005 disabled them and the current v006 procedure omits them.",
    "The PA9 USB VBUS input is loaded to about 1 V through the revision-0.1 100 kOhm divider; V1 firmware disables VBUS sensing.",
    "LED1 is powered from +5V and receives 3.3V data without a level shifter; this worked on the first assembled board but should gain a level shifter in V2.",
    "The BMI270 uses SPI3 alternate function 6 on PB3/PB4/PB5 and was verified on assembled hardware."
  ]
}
